### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

###
### 1. Login (guarda tokens A)
POST {{kc}}/realms/stockea/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=stockea-pwd-verifier&client_secret={{verifier_secret}}&username={{username}}&password={{old_password}}

> {% client.global.set("access_a", response.body.access_token);
    client.global.set("refresh_a", response.body.refresh_token); %}

### 2. Login con contraseña incorrecta (espera 401)
POST {{kc}}/realms/stockea/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=stockea-pwd-verifier&client_secret={{verifier_secret}}&username={{username}}&password=incorrecta123

### 3. Token del service account
POST {{kc}}/realms/stockea/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=client_credentials&client_id=stockea-admin-api&client_secret={{admin_secret}}

> {% client.global.set("admin_token", response.body.access_token); %}

### 4. Cambiar la contraseña (espera 204)
PUT {{kc}}/admin/realms/stockea/users/{{user_id}}/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "type": "password", "value": "{{new_password}}", "temporary": false }

### 5. Cerrar las sesiones del usuario (espera 204)
POST {{kc}}/admin/realms/stockea/users/{{user_id}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 6. Renovar con el refresh token VIEJO (espera 400 invalid_grant)
POST {{kc}}/realms/stockea/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&client_id=stockea-pwd-verifier&client_secret={{verifier_secret}}&refresh_token={{refresh_a}}

### 7a. Login con la contraseña NUEVA (espera 200)
POST {{kc}}/realms/stockea/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=stockea-pwd-verifier&client_secret={{verifier_secret}}&username={{username}}&password={{new_password}}

### 7b. Login con la contraseña VIEJA (espera 401)
POST {{kc}}/realms/stockea/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=stockea-pwd-verifier&client_secret={{verifier_secret}}&username={{username}}&password={{old_password}}